Subject: [PATCH] cervical-epic v0.1: VAL-072/073/074/076/077/081 + VAL-071
 landscape + Biological_Physics README
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Six VAL studies on total n=807 samples scored across every publicly-accessible
450K/EPIC cervical methylation cohort per CCL-029 cohort-completeness.

Tissue arm at total n=313 across three cohorts:
- VAL-073 GSE99511 Verlaat (Amsterdam, n=68): Normal vs CIN3 d=+0.73 [+0.22, +1.24]
  p=0.004 monotonic Normal<CIN3<SCC. POSITIVE ANCHOR.
- VAL-074 GSE46306 Farkas (Stockholm, n=43): Normal vs CIN3 d=-0.61 [-1.27, +0.05].
  Cohort uses HPV-negative healthy as normal selection per Farkas 2013 paper.
  O5_NEGATIVE_DIRECTION.
- VAL-081 GSE68339 Lando (Oslo, n=270 SCC tumors): External vs VAL-073 normals
  d=-0.43 [-0.82, -0.04]; only 6.7% above VAL-073 normal p95.
  O5_NEGATIVE_DIRECTION confirms VAL-074 cohort-direction-flip pattern.

Two of three tissue cohorts read negative-direction. VAL-073 is the outlier,
not the artifact. Cohort heterogeneity surfaces only at full breadth — single-cohort
validation would have missed it.

LBC primary pathway:
- VAL-076 GSE143752 El-Zein (Quebec, n=186 LBC EPIC 850K): d=-0.114 flat.
  O6_UNEXPECTED panel-transferability flag (Xu-538 was buffy-coat trained;
  LBC = different cell mixture; clinical-grade panels FAM19A4/PAX1 detect
  strong signal in same data).
- VAL-077 GSE287994 Bowden (Imperial London, n=247 LBC EPIC 850K): d=-0.029 flat.
  O6_UNEXPECTED data integrity flag — supplementary file is residual M-values
  per Bowden 2025 Methods, NOT raw beta. CHK-3.1 distribution check failed.
  Deferred to v0.2+ raw IDAT processing.

Excluded/Deferred:
- VAL-075 GSE38266 EXCLUDED at runtime (HNSCC, not cervical; cerv-LL-008).
- VAL-078 CINCS Bukowski 2023 + VAL-079 Sundström CIN2 deferred to v0.2+
  contact list (data not GEO-deposited).

Card publishes at exploratory_with_cohort_heterogeneity tier (new tier added
to master README v2.1 specifically for cohort-direction-flip pattern).

CCL-032 promoted to absolute rule on April 25 based on this build:
diagnostic order is fixed: data integrity -> biology -> framework. Never
the reverse. Cards verified clean: pancreatic-epic v0.1, crc-epic v2.3,
cervical-epic v0.1.

H_min(immune) = 0.838889 throughout (panc-LL-007 universal Stage 1 rule).
Xu-538 panel SHA: ada672960...
RNG seed: 20260425.
